OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do Christmas market traders
OL,4,Asay about rising prices?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMention Christmas markets these days
OL,7,Fand the conversation often turns to
OL,8,Frising prices ` from #8 bratwursts, #11
OL,9,FYorkshire pudding wraps and even #5 for
OL,10,Fa few marshmallow sticks.
OL,12,FBut what do the people behind the
OL,13,Fstalls think? Are they benefiting from
OL,14,Fthe hikes or are their own profits
OL,15,Fbeing squeezed?
OL,17,FTraders at Manchester's Christmas
OL,18,Fmarkets told the BBC they were feeling
OL,19,Fthe pressure of increasing bills for
OL,20,Fstaff, ingredients and energy, with
OL,21,Fsome saying they were making less money
OL,22,Fdespite charging more.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
