OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do Christmas market traders
OL,4,Asay about rising prices?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne trader said it costs at least
OL,7,F#4,000 a day to run each her four
OL,8,Fstalls, while another has cut prices to
OL,9,Fkeep customers coming back.
